Then the results are injected back into a subsequent researcher prompt in a form that looks like:

Tool results:
<tool_result name="search_nearform_knowledge">"<JSON_RESULTS_OBJECT>"</tool_result>

<REST_OF_RESEARCHER_PROMPT>
