Other things to check out in the demo

With these notes, you are encouraged to go try out the Web Agents demo a bit more! The Agent Activity pane contains all the internal events that correspond to everything we’ve discussed in the article, and you can click to drill into more information for most of them (including inputs, outputs, prompts, tool calls, etc.). It may be a bit slow (welcome to on-device AI, folks), but it’s a fully functional, multi-agent system with remote tool calling. Even with those rough edges, the demo shows something meaningful about where the web is heading.
